  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Paradiso is a CBO of more than thousand people affected by TB in 20 districts in Malawi. They empower and strengthen community systems that deliver integrated people centered, gender- focused care with interventions like active case finding, public awareness, treatment support and community-based lung rehabilitation for people living with post-TB disability. It generates evidence of the effectiveness; this includes evaluating case finding yield, end-of-treatment morbidity, cost effectiveness and gender barriers.</narrative>
  </description>
